      "rank_group": 1,
      "rank_absolute": 2,
      "markdown": "If you're looking for **smart lock installation in South Melbourne**, here are a few reputable options:\n\n- [SMART LOCK INSTALLATION](https://www.smartlockinstallation.com.au/) – Specialist installer focused on smart locks from brands such as Yale, Lockwood, Philips, Aqara, Schlage, Eufy, and others. They offer installation across Melbourne and have extensive experience with residential and apartment installations. [Smart Lock Installation](https://www.smartlockinstallation.com.au/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n- [Locksmith CBD & Albert park](https://www.cbdalbertparklocksmiths.com.au/) – Mobile locksmith servicing South Melbourne with smart lock installation, lock replacements, and emergency services available 24/7. [cbdalbertparklocksmiths.com.au](https://www.cbdalbertparklocksmiths.com.au/locations/south-melbourne?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n- [Virtual office - Titan Locksmiths & Access Security Melbourne](https://www.titanlocksmiths.com.au/) – Provides residential and commercial locksmith services, including smart lock installation and electronic access solutions. [Corporate Locksmiths](https://www.corplock.com.au/pages/locksmith-south-melbourne?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n- [Port Melbourne Locksmiths](http://www.portmelbournelocksmiths.com.au/) – Well-reviewed local locksmith that installs and services a range of digital and smart locks.\n\nIf you haven't purchased a lock yet, it's worth confirming with the installer:\n\n- Whether your existing door is compatible.\n- Which brands they recommend for your needs (fingerprint, keypad, Apple Home, Google Home, Alexa, etc.).\n- Whether installation includes app setup, user code configuration, and warranty support.\n\nAs a guide, professional installation in Melbourne typically ranges from **A$150–A$350** for a straightforward replacement, with additional costs if door modifications or a new deadbolt are required. [centrelock.com.au](https://www.centrelock.com.au/smart-lock-installation/?utm_source=chatgpt.com) [Smart Lock Installation](https://www.smartlockinstallation.com.au/?utm_source=chatgpt.com) \n\nIf you tell me:\n\n- whether it's a **house or apartment**,\n- the **type of door** (timber, metal, security screen, etc.), and\n- whether you **already have a smart lock** or need one supplied,\n\nI can recommend the most suitable installer and lock for your situation.\n\n",
